<DetailLayout
  title="The French Concession — Shanghai's Most Charming Quarter"
  subtitle="Plane trees, hidden lanes, Art Deco villas, and the best cafe district in China. The former French Concession is where Shanghai slows down — here is how to explore it the right way."
  description="Complete French Concession guide: the best streets to wander (Wukang Road, Anfu Road), how to get there by Metro, top sights like Xintiandi and Sun Yat-sen's former residence, shopping, food, and family tips."
